{"title": "Catatonic (Condition)", "pageid": 40626, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Catatonic_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Catatonic</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Art Cullagh has shut down and seems completely unresponsive to whatever is happening around him. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Stunned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Stunned\">SG_Stunned</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Condition\" title=\"SG Condition\">SG_Condition</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/InitiateCombat\" title=\"Status properties/InitiateCombat\">InitiateCombat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/OverheadOnTurn\" title=\"Status properties/OverheadOnTurn\">OverheadOnTurn</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition persists until the party wake up <a href=\"/wiki/Art_Cullagh\" title=\"Art Cullagh\">Art Cullagh</a> with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Battered_Lute\" title=\"Battered Lute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Instrument_Lute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Battered_Lute\" title=\"Battered Lute\">Battered Lute</a></span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Catatonic\">Creatures with Catatonic</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Art_Cullagh\" title=\"Art Cullagh\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png/30px-Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png/45px-Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png/60px-Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Art Cullagh\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png/30px-Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Portrait_Art_Cullagh.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Art_Cullagh\" title=\"Art Cullagh\">Art Cullagh</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715155751\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1757/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17778/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 